ecord of the adoption or the mechanism text itself, superseded for V1 by this row. The frozen copies in `formal/freeze-v1/objects/spec.bin` are covered by the same disposition; their bytes are not edited. The owner grepped every registered and frozen text for the listing's vocabulary on 2026-10-29, and no other mention remains undisposed. Release-key custody (A10.4.2) is separate and unchanged. Option (a) applies (rows 15–16). A10.4.2 (rows 34–36) is unchanged. Row 33 stands as registered cut-order text, since (e) is narrowed, not withdrawn. Its "second item cut is the service-key listing" has no referent in V1. Its other sentences (option (a) applies, the absence of new-key protection is stated, no cure for release-key independence) are met by the ruling and profile §5 (`270ca49:docs/V1-PROFILE.md:619-623`). Profile :619-622 and :1258-1262 are then consistent as written. Kind C/W, recorded here because no signed change table lists it |
